  <name>Sentinel Video Client</name>
  <summary>Video surveillance client for Hikvision and RTSP cameras</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Sentinel is a local Linux client for video surveillance in the style of HikCentral Lite and iVMS-4200:
      live view with saved views, playback with a recording timeline, alarms and events, ANPR vehicle lists,
      access control, e-maps and backup recording to the local computer.
    </p>
  </description>
